---

<section class="section problem" id="why">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="section-head problem-head">
			<p class="eyebrow">The Problem</p>
			<h2>Building the decision is easy. Operating it reliably is not.</h2>
			<p class="lede">
				A credit decision is more than a score. It is the coordinated result of
				provider integrations, retries, orchestration, policy, evidence, and
				audit — most of which is infrastructure, not business logic.
			</p>
		</div>

		<ul class="problem-list">
			<li>
				<span class="problem-num">01</span>
				<p>Provider integrations for identity, credit, KYC, and fraud</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<span class="problem-num">02</span>
				<p>Retries, timeouts, and failure handling around external calls</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<span class="problem-num">03</span>
				<p>Orchestration that sequences steps in the right order</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<span class="problem-num">04</span>
				<p>Scoring logic and deterministic policy rules</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<span class="problem-num">05</span>
				<p>Evidence capture and an audit trail for every decision</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<span class="problem-num">06</span>
				<p>Structured reasons that explain why a decision was made</p>
			</li>
		</ul>

		<p class="problem-outro">
			The hard part is not finding data or calculating a score. It is
			coordinating an entire decision process reliably — and proving that you
			did. That coordination is what Credora provides.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.problem {
		background: var(--c-bg-light);
	}

	.problem-list {
		list-style: none;
		margin: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem) 0 0;
		padding: 0;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		gap: 0.75rem;
	}

	.problem-list li {
		display: flex;
		align-items: baseline;
		gap: 1rem;
		padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem;
		background: var(--c-bg-elev-light);
		border: 1px solid var(--c-line);
		border-radius: var(--radius);
	}

	.problem-num {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: var(--c-accent);
		flex: 0 0 auto;
	}

	.problem-list p {
		color: var(--c-ink);
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.problem-outro {
		margin-top: 2rem;
		padding-left: 1rem;
		border-left: 2px solid var(--c-accent);
		color: var(--c-muted);
		font-size: 1.0625rem;
		max-width: 42rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.problem-list {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>